  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7524893b534d0b761f00198cefad34d26261c699.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/94dc67d898479fd934e4710c552c5d9c72bee24c.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n此资源包在原生Minecraft中无法使用。你必须安装Hold My Items Animation模组，若想在游戏中更换图腾模型，还需下载Respackopts模组。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hold-my-items\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dbfb3032a0b4d78e24701cc19f557afe6dba5b17.png\" width=\"280\" alt=\"图片1\">\n  </a>\n  \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62f097d3725f173dfbddb5c261ddc8b1fcd5e6b2.png\" width=\"280\" alt=\"图片2\">\n  </a>\n\n  <p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7524893b534d0b761f00198cefad34d26261c699.png\">\n</p>\n\n![关于](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c23a25019880c315acc125ca53855d1ee9f30631.png)\n---\n此资源包将不死图腾的外观进行了革新，赋予其全新的半透明质感，风格类似于“Action and Stuff”模组中的效果。\n\n由WinterS制作",
